{"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/walletkit\/initializeawalletandsendatransaction"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"primaryContentSections":[{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2,"anchor":"Overview"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"This tutorial uses an Ethereum testnet endpoint. Replace the endpoint and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"recipient with values appropriate for your application, and present the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transfer details to the person before requesting a signature."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"heading","level":2,"anchor":"Create-the-Wallet","text":"Create the Wallet"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Generate a recovery phrase, derive the first Ethereum BIP-44 account, and"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"create a signer for the selected chain. Store the recovery phrase using your"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"application’s secure backup flow before deriving accounts from it."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import Foundation","import WalletKit","","let chainId: UInt64 = 11_155_111 \/\/ Sepolia","","let mnemonic = Mnemonic.generate(wordCount: .words24)","let seed = mnemonic.toSeed()","","let derivationPath = try DerivationPath(","    .evm(EVMBlockchain(chainId: chainId)),","    accountIndex: 0,","    curve: .secp256k1",")","","let privateKey = try seed","    .masterKey(curve: .secp256k1)","    .derive(derivationPath)","    .privateKey()","    ","let signer = try EthereumPKeySigner(","    chainId: chainId,","    privateKey: privateKey,","    derivationPath: derivationPath",")","","let sender = try signer.address()"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Never print or transmit "},{"code":"mnemonic.phrase","type":"codeVoice"},{"type":"text","text":", "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"seed"},{"type":"text","text":", or "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"privateKey"},{"type":"text","text":". An"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"application normally retains only the encrypted wallet material it needs to"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"restore the account later."}]},{"type":"heading","text":"Build, Sign, and Broadcast a Transfer","anchor":"Build-Sign-and-Broadcast-a-Transfer","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Use a client for the same chain as the signer. The transaction builder retrieves"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the current nonce and fee information before preparing the unsigned transfer."}]},{"type":"codeListing","syntax":"swift","code":["import BigInt","","let client = EthereumRPCClient(","    endpoint: URL(string: \"https:\/\/your-sepolia-rpc.example\")!,","    chainId: chainId",")","","let recipient = try EthereumAddress(","    string: \"0x000000000000000000000000000000000000dEaD\"",")","","let transactionBuilder = EthereumTransactionBuilder(client: client)","","let unsignedTransaction = try await transactionBuilder.buildTransfer(","    sender: sender,","    recipient: recipient,","    amount: BigUInt(1_000_000_000_000_000), \/\/ 0.001 ETH in wei","    token: nil",")","","let signedTransaction = try await signer.sign(transaction: unsignedTransaction)","let transactionHash = try await client.broadcast(signedTransaction)"]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"codeVoice","code":"broadcast(_:)"},{"type":"text","text":" reports that the node accepted the transaction; it is not a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"confirmation. Continue observing the transaction or refresh the account state"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"until the required confirmation policy is met."}]}]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Create an Ethereum account from a new recovery phrase and submit a native ETH transfer."}],"metadata":{"title":"Initialize a Wallet and Send